          <h2 class="heading-2 mb-4">Editorial Standards</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
            We are committed to maintaining high editorial standards:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-muted-foreground space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Sources:</strong> We cite credible news organizations and primary sources whenever possible</li>
            <li><strong>Objectivity:</strong> We aim to present balanced analysis from multiple perspectives</li>
            <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We clearly distinguish between reported facts and our own analysis</li>
            <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> We welcome corrections and will update content when errors are identified</li>
